  "content": "\n\n# Tschipcraft 的更多生物\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/Tschipcraft/more_mobs/stargazers\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/stars/Tschipcraft/more_mobs?colorA=1b1b29&colorB=bd5216&style=for-the-badge\" title=\"GitHub stars\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mod-more-mobs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/909654?logo=curseforge&label=CurseForge&colorA=1b1b29&colorB=bd5216&style=for-the-badge\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/Tschipcraft/more_mobs/releases/latest\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/downloads/Tschipcraft/more_mobs/total?logo=github&colorA=1b1b29&colorB=bd5216&style=for-the-badge\" title=\"GitHub downloads\"></a>\n\n> 適用於 1.14.x-26.2.x 的伺服器端資料包/模組\n\n<details>\n<summary>YouTube 展示影片</summary>\n<iframe width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/sruFdJCgIDo\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n</details>\n\n## 功能特色\n\n生物透過自訂頭像或未使用的原版生物獲得新變體！本資料包使用**超過 85 個自訂玩家頭像**，可取得並放置於您的世界中。蜘蛛在懸掛於天花板時也會倒掛。<br>\n\n**支援的生物：**\n殭屍、枯尸、溺屍、骷髏、流浪者、凋靈骷髏、哞菇、豬布林、掠奪者、喚魔師與伏擊者\n\n此資料包/模組完全為伺服器端運作，但也可安裝於客戶端以用於單人世界！不需要資源包！\n\n[-> 查看所有新增頭像與可用設定，請前往維基 <-](https://github.com/Tschipcraft/more_mobs/wiki)\n\n\n## 安裝方式\n\n選擇以下任一方式安裝：\n\n* **資料包 [DP]** ➜ 將 `.zip` 檔案放入世界的 `datapacks` 資料夾中\n* **模組 [Mod]** ➜ 放入 `mods` 資料夾，並可選安裝 [MidnightLib](https://modrinth.com/project/codAaoxh) 以取得全域設定檔與介面\n\n若要管理設定、重設或解除安裝，請使用 `/trigger tschipcraft.menu` 或 `/function #tschipcraft:menu`。\n\n\n## 相容性\n\n已測試與 [Rare Mobs (PMC)](https://www.planetminecraft.com/data-pack/rare-mobs-5186029/) 及 [Mob Captains](https://modrinth.com/datapack/mob-captains) 相容。\n\n<img title=\"Supported Minecraft versions\" src=\"https://tschipo.alwaysdata.net/assets/supported?untested_versions=26.3.x&supported_versions=1.14.x,1.15.x,1.16.x,1.17.x,1.18.x,1.19.x,1.20.x,1.21.x,26.1.x,26.2.x&total_versions=%3C=1.13,1.14.x,1.15.x,1.16.x,1.17.x,1.18.x,1.19.x,1.20.x,1.21.x,26.1.x,26.2.x,26.3.x&progress_bar=false&mc_background=false&icons=true&platform=modrinth\">\n\n**Forge** 僅原生支援至 Minecraft 1.21.5。\n\n此資料包遵循 [Smithed](https://wiki.smithed.dev/conventions/) 與必要 [MC Datapacks Discord 伺服器](https://mc-datapacks.github.io/en/conventions/index.html) 的規範，以確保資料包的相容性。\n\n\n## 目前問題\n\n> <img alt=\"Issue:\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Mqxx/GitHub-Markdown/main/blockquotes/badge/dark-theme/issue.svg\">\n>\n> 目前與 [Special Mobs](https://modrinth.com/datapack/special-mobs) 不相容 - [詳見 #7](https://github.com/Tschipcraft/more_mobs/issues/7)。此問題將於未來版本修復。\n\n\n## 外部連結\n\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/more-mobs\">\n<img width=\"40px\" alt=\"CurseForge logo\" title=\"View Tschipcraft's More Mobs on CurseForge\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Tschipcraft/badges/main/assets/curseforge-modrinth.svg\">\n</a>\n\n<a href=\"https://www.planetminecraft.com/data-pack/more-mobs-4988371/\">\n<img width=\"40px\" alt=\"PlanetMinecraft logo\" title=\"View Tschipcraft's More Mobs on PlanetMinecraft\" src=\"https://www.planetminecraft.com/images/layout/favicon-128.png\">\n</a>\n\n<a href=\"https://tschipcraft.ddns.net/en/more_mobs.html\">\n<picture>\n  <source width=\"40px\" media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://gistcdn.githack.com/Tschipcraft/dd29a827fa843ed52e7efc7801c48421/raw/7ab31174b119403a1deff072e3ae16fe43a9ed59/website_logo_modrinth.svg\">\n  <source width=\"40px\" media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://tschipcraft.ddns.net/assets/images/logo-black-1.svg\">\n  <img width=\"40px\" title=\"View Tschipcraft's More Mobs on my website\" src=\"https://gistcdn.githack.com/Tschipcraft/dd29a827fa843ed52e7efc7801c48421/raw/7ab31174b119403a1deff072e3ae16fe43a9ed59/website_logo_modrinth.svg\">\n</picture>\n</a>\n\n<a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/C0C5HEJB2\">\n<img width=\"250px\" title=\"Support me on Ko-fi\" src=\"https://storage.ko-fi.com/cdn/brandasset/kofi_button_red.png\">\n</a>\n\n\n## 合作夥伴優惠\n\n想要購買 **Hytale** 或升級您的版本？在結帳時使用創作者代碼 `Tschipcraft`，我將獲得一筆佣金！（您的價格不會改變）\n\n<a href=\"https://billing.sparkedhost.com/aff.php?aff=2611\">\n<img title=\"透過在 Sparked Host 購買伺服器來支持我（此為聯盟連結）\" src=\"https://tschipo.alwaysdata.net/assets/partner/sparked_banner.png\">\n</a>",
